  },
  {
   "type": "image",
   "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/article-images/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-frankfurt/lh_app_frankfurt_city_getty1392119944_16x9.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
   "contentDescription": "View through a skyscraper canyon in Frankfurt"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "A Perfect Day in Frankfurt",
   "size": "EXTRA_LARGE",
   "variant": "HEADLINE"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>9. October 2025 | 2 min read | Julia Buth</b>",
   "size": "SMALL",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Julia Buth, a flight attendant at Lufthansa, lived in Frankfurt for a long time and describes her perfect day there.</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Morning</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "image",
   "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/article-images/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-frankfurt/lh_app_frankfurt_cafe-karin_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
   "contentDescription": "Various dishes at Café Karin"
  },
  {
   "type": "spacer",
   "size": "MEDIUM"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Breakfast at Café Karin</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<ul><li>Whether it's bowls, sandwiches, or pancakes, this long-established café prepares every dish with lots of love and regional ingredients</li></ul>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "Großer Hirschgraben&nbsp;28",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Goethe's Birthplace</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<ul><li>Right across from Café Karin, you'll find Goethe's birthplace, which still looks as if the famous poet and his family had just moved out</li><li>My tip is to take a short walk to the Museumsufer Frankfurt</li></ul>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "Hirschgraben 21",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Midday</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "image",
   "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/article-images/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-frankfurt/lh_app_frankfurt_staedel-museum_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
   "contentDescription": "People inside the Städel Museum Frankfurt"
  },
  {
   "type": "spacer",
   "size": "MEDIUM"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Städel Museum</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<ul><li>Whenever I’m in the mood for art, I visit the Städel Museum, where I can explore masterpieces from the past seven centuries.</li><li>For even more culture, head to one of the many museums along the iconic Museumsufer by the Main</li></ul>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "Schaumainkai 63",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Chilling at Main Café</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<ul><li>On summer days, I grab a deck chair at Main Café, watch the crowds of day-trippers, and take in the view of the Frankfurt skyline</li></ul>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "Schaumainkai 50",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "spacer",
   "size": "MEDIUM"
  },
  {
   "type": "textLink_v2",
   "text": "More about Europe",
