   "size": "MEDIUM"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Afternoon</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "image",
   "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/article-images/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-frankfurt/lh_app_frankfurt_gettyImages1449117784_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
   "contentDescription": "Pedestrians cross an intersection in Frankfurt am Main"
  },
  {
   "type": "spacer",
   "size": "MEDIUM"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Tapas at the Kleinmarkthalle</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<ul><li>Frankfurt's multicultural vibe really shines at the Kleinmarkthalle, where traders sell fruit, vegetables, and specialties from all over the world from Monday through Saturday</li><li>My shopping insider tip is Berger Strasse in the Bornheim district, which is packed with owner-run shops offering extraordinary and unique finds</li></ul>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "Hasengasse 5-7",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Evening</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "image",
   "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/article-images/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-frankfurt/lh_app_frankfurt_berger-streetfood_shutterstock394084948_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
   "contentDescription": "Close-up of sushi on a slate plate"
  },
  {
   "type": "spacer",
   "size": "MEDIUM"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Sushi on&nbsp;Berger Straße</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<ul><li>Berger Strasse is full of cozy cafés on every corner</li><li>At Berger Streetfood, you'll find the best sushi in town – definitely worth the wait</li><li>My recommendation is to end the night dancing in the laid-back living-room vibe of the Saint Tropez Bar in the Bahnhofsviertel</li></ul>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "Copyrights: George Miguletz, Café Karin, Getty Images, Shutterstock",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>About</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "Julia Buth started her career as a flight attendant at Lufthansa in 2008. Since 2023, she has been a purser on short- and long-haul flights.",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
